  (text "Traegerplatine fuer Arduino Nano (ATmega328P, gesteckt). Gleiche Belegung und Firmware wie die Uno-Variante:\nAdressbus A0-A12 ueber 2x 74HC595 (SPI: D11, D13, Latch A2), Datenbus D0-D7 an Nano D2-D9, Versorgung Cartridge D10, Messung A0.\nFirmware: github.com/sfambach/arduino-atari2600-cart-reader - fambach.net"
    (at 30 185 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "0b37e96a-b684-496e-bee9-524834714647"))
